{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"statistics-lesson04","version":1,"title":"数理統計","subtitle":"第4回 · 元の資料5・t分布と信頼区間","scope":"数理統計5.pdf、全15物理ページ。元の資料5・t分布と信頼区間。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期木１]数理統計/数理統計5.pdf","sha256":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029","pageCount":15,"reviewedPages":[9,10,11,13,14],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"statistics-l04-q01","version":1,"prompt":"\\(Z\\sim N(0,1)\\)と\\(V\\sim\\chi^2_\\nu\\)は独立とする。自由度νのt分布を作る式は？","answer":"\\(T=Z/\\sqrt{V/\\nu}\\)。","criterion":"独立なカイ二乗変数を自由度で割り、その平方根で標準正規変数を割れれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計5.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:9"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z\\sim N(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>と<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∼</mo><msubsup><mi>χ</mi><mi>ν</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\sim\\chi^2_\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span>は独立とする。自由度νのt分布を作る式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=Z/\\sqrt{V/\\nu}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"独立なカイ二乗変数を自由度で割り、その平方根で標準正規変数を割れれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l04-q02","version":1,"prompt":"n≥2個の独立なN(μ,σ²)標本で、\\(\\bar X\\)は標本平均、\\(S^2=\\sum_i(X_i-\\bar X)^2/(n-1)\\)。\\(\\sqrt n(\\bar X-\\mu)/S\\)の分布は？σ>0とする。","answer":"自由度n−1のt分布。","criterion":"自由度も含めて言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計5.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:10"}],"promptHtml":"n≥2個の独立なN(μ,σ²)標本で、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar X</annotation></semantics></math></span>は標本平均、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^2=\\sum_i(X_i-\\bar X)^2/(n-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt n(\\bar X-\\mu)/S</annotation></semantics></math></span>の分布は？σ&gt;0とする。","answerHtml":"自由度n−1のt分布。","criterionHtml":"自由度も含めて言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l04-q03","version":1,"prompt":"自由度νのt分布は、ν→∞でどの分布に近づく？","answer":"標準正規分布N(0,1)。","criterion":"標準正規分布と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計5.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:11"}],"promptHtml":"自由度νのt分布は、ν→∞でどの分布に近づく？","answerHtml":"標準正規分布N(0,1)。","criterionHtml":"標準正規分布と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l04-q04","version":1,"prompt":"自由度ν>2のt分布の分散は？","answer":"\\(\\nu/(\\nu-2)\\)。","criterion":"自由度の条件と式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計5.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:11"}],"promptHtml":"自由度ν&gt;2のt分布の分散は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu/(\\nu-2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"自由度の条件と式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l04-q05","version":1,"prompt":"未知母数θの信頼度1−αの信頼区間を、標本から作る下限Lと上限Uの確率で表すと？","answer":"\\(P_\\theta(L\\leq\\theta\\leq U)=1-\\alpha\\)。","criterion":"確率変数は区間の両端であると分かる式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"数理統計5.pdf","page":13,"imageKey":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:13"}],"promptHtml":"未知母数θの信頼度1−αの信頼区間を、標本から作る下限Lと上限Uの確率で表すと？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_\\theta(L\\leq\\theta\\leq U)=1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"確率変数は区間の両端であると分かる式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"statistics-l04-q06","version":1,"prompt":"信頼度95％の区間推定を同じ方法で繰り返すとき、95％とは何の割合？","answer":"作られる区間のうち、真の母数を含む区間の長期的な割合。","criterion":"標本を取り直した区間の被覆割合と言えれば正解。","explanation":"観測済みの1つの区間に、固定された母数が95％の確率で入るという意味ではない。","sources":[{"file":"数理統計5.pdf","page":14,"imageKey":"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:14"}],"promptHtml":"信頼度95％の区間推定を同じ方法で繰り返すとき、95％とは何の割合？","answerHtml":"作られる区間のうち、真の母数を含む区間の長期的な割合。","criterionHtml":"標本を取り直した区間の被覆割合と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"観測済みの1つの区間に、固定された母数が95％の確率で入るという意味ではない。"}],"sourceImages":{"0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:9":"./assets/sources/0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029-9.png","0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:10":"./assets/sources/0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029-10.png","0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:11":"./assets/sources/0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029-11.png","0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:13":"./assets/sources/0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029-13.png","0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029:14":"./assets/sources/0231d0aa43a8084a1d7c9f1c1fb644ec94682ff7dd8f75604a66b0fdada15029-14.png"},"renderVersion":1}